OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy cloud and isolated
OL,6,Fshowers to start, with fog over
OL,7,Fnorthern hills. Showers slowly dying
OL,8,Fout to leave a dry afternoon with
OL,9,Fsunny spells, before Storm Austen
OL,10,Fbrings rain to the south coast by
OL,11,Fevening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHeavy rain and hill fog
OL,14,Fpushes northeastwards with Storm
OL,15,FAusten. Gusty over high ground
OL,16,Fovernight, then gales reach the
OL,17,Fsouthwest of the country around dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
