OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain pushes northeastwards and
OL,6,Fstrong winds become more widespread
OL,7,Fthrough the day. Gales continue in
OL,8,Fcoastal areas.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FStrong
OL,11,Fwinds and heavy rain Saturday before a
OL,12,Fbrief settled interlude brings sunny
OL,13,Fspells and isolated light showers on
OL,14,FSunday. Further wind and rain arrives
OL,15,Fovernight into Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
